Settings › AI: one "Ask answers with" picker, "Your AI" lists only what is
on this computer (each CLI with its accounts: add, rename, sign in, remove),
the rest folded under "More AI tools", your own server folded. With two
accounts of one CLI, a card offers Work in Work and Personal in Personal.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
